  "profile": {
    "description": "Help your child read with confidence at ExcelKidsHub Phonics Academy, Dhanori\u0027s trusted center for early literacy. We are an ISO 9001:2015 certified and MSME (Udyam) registered institute building strong English foundations.\nLed by Certified Trainer Swati Deshmukh, we use the proven Jolly Phonics method to help children (ages 4–12) read fluently and master grammar naturally.\nWhy Parents Trust Us:\n✅ Expert Guidance: Taught by a certified professional.\n✅ Personalized Attention: Small batches ensure no child is left behind.\n✅ Flexible Learning: Offline classes in Pune (Dhanori) \u0026 interactive online sessions globally.\n✅ Visible Results: Improved pronunciation, spelling, and speed.\n📞 Contact us today for a Free Assessment!"
  },
